INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, category, cover_image, content, published, published_at) VALUES ('whatsapp-vs-forms', 'Why Indian Customers Prefer WhatsApp Over Website Forms', 'Friction kills enquiries. Here''s why click-to-WhatsApp buttons can double your enquiry rate compared with old-style contact forms.', 'WhatsApp Automation', '/assets/portfolio/gen_coaching.jpg', 'Look at your own phone. How many unread emails do you have? Now, how many unread WhatsApp chats? For most people in India the answer is obvious — WhatsApp is where real conversations happen.

## Forms feel like work

A contact form asks for name, email, phone, subject and message, then sends it into an inbox nobody checks quickly. On a small phone screen, every extra field means more people give up.

## WhatsApp feels like a conversation

A click-to-WhatsApp button opens a chat with a ready-made message like “Hi, I want the price list”. One tap, and the customer is talking to you. Add an instant auto-reply and they get an answer while they''re still interested.

- Use one clear WhatsApp button on every screen
- Pre-fill the message with what the customer wants
- Reply instantly with a menu: prices, timings, booking
- Save every chat as a lead in Google Sheets', 1, '2026-10-20');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, category, cover_image, content, published, published_at) VALUES ('slow-website', 'Why Your Website Is Slow (And What It''s Costing You)', 'If your site takes more than 3 seconds to load on mobile, most local buyers leave. Here''s how lean code keeps load times under 1.5s.', 'Website Speed', '/assets/portfolio/gen_clinic.jpg', 'Most local customers find you on a phone, often on mobile data. If your page shows a blank screen for three or four seconds, they press back and call your competitor.

## Common reasons websites are slow

- Heavy themes and dozens of plugins
- Huge, uncompressed photos
- Sliders, pop-ups and scripts nobody needs
- Cheap overloaded hosting

## What fast looks like

A focused page with compressed images, clean code and good hosting can load in under 1.5 seconds. That speed helps your Google ranking too — Google rewards pages that load fast on mobile.

Quick test: open your website on your phone using mobile data. If you get bored waiting, so do your customers.', 1, '2026-10-17');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, category, cover_image, content, published, published_at) VALUES ('meta-ads-local', 'How Local Clinics & Salons Get Daily Enquiries on ₹300/Day', 'You don''t need a big budget. Radius targeting on Facebook & Instagram brings genuine nearby customers straight to your WhatsApp.', 'Meta Ads', '/assets/portfolio/gen_salon.jpg', 'Big brands advertise to everyone. A local clinic or salon only needs people who live or work within a few kilometres. That''s what makes local ads affordable.

## The simple local ad recipe

1. Target a 5–15 km radius around your business
2. Show one clear offer — a first-visit discount, free check-up or trial
3. Use real photos or a short reel of your work
4. Use a “Send Message” button that opens WhatsApp
5. Reply instantly with an automated menu

Start with ₹200–₹400 per day for one to two weeks, track which ad brings the most WhatsApp chats, then put more budget behind the winner.', 1, '2026-10-14');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, category, cover_image, content, published, published_at) VALUES ('google-maps-top-3', 'Google Business Profile Checklist: Rank in the Top 3 on Maps', 'A simple checklist to optimise your shop, clinic or service profile so nearby customers find you before your competitors.', 'Local SEO', '/assets/portfolio/gen_travel.jpg', 'When someone searches “dentist near me” or “coaching centre in Salt Lake”, Google shows three businesses on a map. Being in those three is worth more than any billboard.

## The checklist

1. Choose the most accurate primary category
2. Write a clear description with your services and area
3. Add real photos every month — shop, team, work
4. Keep hours, phone and website link correct
5. Ask every happy customer for a Google review, and reply to all reviews
6. Post offers and updates on your profile regularly

Link your profile to a fast website with the same name, address and phone number. Consistency builds trust with Google.', 1, '2026-10-11');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, category, cover_image, content, published, published_at) VALUES ('leads-google-sheets', 'How to Save WhatsApp Enquiries to Google Sheets Automatically', 'Never lose track of a prospect again. A simple workflow to organise leads, numbers and requirements without a complicated CRM.', 'Workflows', '/assets/portfolio/gen_coaching.jpg', 'Many businesses lose customers simply because enquiries get buried in chats. A shared Google Sheet fixes this without expensive software.

## What to capture for every lead

- Name and phone number
- What they''re interested in
- Where they came from (ad, Google, website)
- Date and follow-up status

With WhatsApp automation, these details can be filled in automatically when someone chooses an option from your menu. Your team checks one sheet every morning and calls the hottest leads first.', 1, '2026-10-08');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO posts (slug, title, excerpt, category, cover_image, content, published, published_at) VALUES ('lead-machine-tweaks', '5 Simple Changes That Turn Your Website Into a 24/7 Lead Machine', 'From a sticky WhatsApp button to local social proof, five quick fixes any local business can apply this week.', 'Conversions', '/assets/portfolio/gen_clinic.jpg', 'You don''t always need a new website. These five changes often double enquiries on an existing one.

1. Put your main offer and a WhatsApp button at the very top
2. Add a sticky WhatsApp button that follows people as they scroll
3. Show real reviews with names and local areas
4. Replace long forms with a 3-field form or one tap to WhatsApp
5. Show prices or “starting from” prices — hidden prices scare buyers away

Make one change at a time and watch your enquiry count for a week. Keep what works.', 1, '2026-10-05');
